**
** Pressures of *DSLOAD on the surfaces of *SURFACE, read from this inp file alone.
** Body A is a cantilever of 4 C3D8 elements fixed at x=0. The surface STOP has the top faces of the element
** set EA (S2, z=1) and SEND the end face of element 4 (S4, x=4), with the pressures 0.1 and 0.2.
** Body B is a C3D10 element whose midside nodes hecmw1 reorders, fixed at its face z=0, with the surface STET
** of its slanted face (S3, x+y+z=7) and the pressure 0.8 scaled by the amplitude HALF (0.5 at the time 1.0).
** The loads sum to (-0.2, 0, -0.4) on body A and (-0.2, -0.2, -0.2) on body B.
** The node surface SNODE is read as a node group, which no condition uses. The element of body B is defined
** first, so that the elements are not in the order of their numbers when *SURFACE refers to them.
**
